<title>SYRIA: Syria offers 2,000 tonnes of lentils for sale.</title>
<headline>Syria offers 2,000 tonnes of lentils for sale.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade (GECPT) said on Wednesday it was offering 2,000 tonnes of whole red lentils for sale and export outside the country, an official spokesman said.</p>
<p>He told Reuters that an international call for price offers had been issued and October 21 was set as final date to receive price offers.</p>
<p>He said the lentils of the 1996 crops would be ready for shipment during November.</p>
</text>
